lay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956040/extras/6562b613deb9c3ee80c1f53b108d436a.poster.avif?t=1749468262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956040/extras/6562b613deb9c3ee80c1f53b108d436a.webm?t=1749468262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956040/extras/6562b613deb9c3ee80c1f53b108d436a.mp4?t=1749468262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kingdom's iconic, handcrafted art style is back, now with a neon touch coming directly from the \u201880s aesthetics. Chill and vibe with the synthy OST from Andreas Hald, and travel back to the wonder days of bike riding and summer camps, when everything seemed possible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival Mixtapes Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956040/extras/5fe715f115cdd6d15524c97e97094566.poster.avif?t=1749468262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956040/extras/5fe715f115cdd6d15524c97e97094566.webm?t=1749468262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956040/extras/5fe715f115cdd6d15524c97e97094566.mp4?t=1749468262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the true arcade style, Kingdom Eighties features a new game mode: Survival Mixtapes! Bring your best tactics and strategies to fend off progressively harder waves of Greed in four different episodes including \u201cBack to the Suburbs\u201d and \u201cGreed, First Goo\u201d. Make on-the-fly decisions as certain buildings\u2019 special abilities are disabled and levels feature random mounts. This game mode is sure to put your skills to the test!</p>",
